  "steps": [
   "Heat the oven to 220°C (200°C fan). Halve the carrots lengthways, then cut into fingers. Tip onto a roasting tray with the onion, chickpeas, 2 tbsp of the oil, the cumin, paprika and most of the salt. Toss well and spread out.",
   "Roast for 20 minutes, until the carrots are starting to brown at the edges.",
   "Rub the kale with the rest of the oil. Stir it through the tray with the pumpkin seeds and roast for 5 minutes more, until the kale is crisp at the edges and the carrots are tender.",
   "Meanwhile, stir the lemon juice and honey into the yoghurt with the rest of the salt.",
